      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-10-015\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"mm-heading mm-h3 mm-header-banner mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20737]\" style=\"background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3.4.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>BLEEDING DISORDERS:</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20738]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Analgesia and Anesthesia:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20739]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Discuss benefits and risks of regional anesthesia</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20740]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Take into accent</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20741]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Overall risk of bleeding</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20742]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Availability of corrective treatment</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20743]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3. Therapeutic and prophylactic anticoagulation</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20744]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4. Risk of bleeding with technique used</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20745]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5. Difficulty of needle sitting or insertion</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20746]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>6. Risk of general anesthesia</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20747]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>7. Risk of no analgesia or </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>non-regional</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> analgesia (comparative risk).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20748]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20749]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20750]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20751]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20752]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20753]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20754]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20755]\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em>(Table on next page)</em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20756]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20757]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20758]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20759]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20760]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20761]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20762]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20763]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20764]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Table: Modifying the birth plan according to maternal platelet count in women with immune thrombocytopenic purpura or gestational thrombocytopenia:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"mm-table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:269.75pt;\"><col style=\"width:269.75pt;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-mm-row-height-twips=\"476\" data-mm-row-height-rule=\"auto\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>Maternal platelet count</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>Maternal care</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips=\"1019\" data-mm-row-height-rule=\"auto\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Platelet count</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>above 80\u00d7109/l</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Treat the woman as healthy for the purpose of considering</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>regional analgesia and anaesthesia</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips=\"1826\" data-mm-row-height-rule=\"auto\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Platelet count 50 to</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>80\u00d7109/l</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Before considering regional analgesia and anaesthesia, take into</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>account:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>\u2022 clinical history</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>\u2022 the woman's preferences</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>\u2022 </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Anaesthetic</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> expertise</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips=\"774\" data-mm-row-height-rule=\"auto\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Platelet count</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>below 50\u00d7109/l</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Avoid regional analgesia and </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>anaesthesia under most </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>circumstances</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20765]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20766]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Birth Plan:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20767]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Babies @ risk of bleeding in ITP.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20768]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Maternal care:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20769]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>platelet count weekly after 36 weeks.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20770]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Birth in obs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tetric</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> led unit with high dependency care for neonate.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20771]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>MDT after platelets &lt; 50 including hematologist.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20772]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Consider giving steroid or immunoglobulins to raise platelet if count is &lt; 50.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20773]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Platelet count @ time of admission.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20774]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Neonatal care:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20775]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Inform neonatal team </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20776]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Don\u2019t do:</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20777]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>FBS</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20778]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ventouse delivery</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20779]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Caution doing:</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20780]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Mid \u2013 cavity or rotational Forceps.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20781]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fetal scalp electrodes.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20782]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Measure platelets in umbilical cord blood </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20783]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>C/S may not protect baby form bleeding</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20784]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>3</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup><strong>rd</strong></sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> stage of Labor:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20785]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>e</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>d risk of primary and secondary hemorrhage </span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"404e1ef6a8ae7f25ec1b2fbb\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-10-015\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 404e1ef6a8ae7f25ec1b2fbb\" viewbox=\"523875 -76200 247650 295275\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"e8a873951dca696e885145fcd7c6255ad15a10a2884265cbdc1a26ea46387938\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-2382e0f66bcba33ad745\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"2382e0f66bcba33ad745\" transform=\"translate(646430 12700)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(2894 66554.5) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(-2894 -66554.5)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 5788 133109\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-2382